{"id":"na0bf33edac","headline":"Surprise inflation drop eases chance of RBA rate hikes","summary":"Australian inflation figures came in below the Reserve Bank's predictions, though some economists warn the data may not paint a full picture. The result lowers the odds of further rate hikes.","why":"The Reserve Bank of Australia sets the cash rate, which influences borrowing costs, the Australian dollar and equity valuations. Inflation data is a key input to its decisions.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Sydney","country":"Australia","lat":-33.87,"lon":151.21,"region":"oc"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"greatlakesadvocate.com.au","url":"https://www.greatlakesadvocate.com.au/story/9319537/surprise-inflation-drop-eases-chance-of-rba-rate-hikes/"},"sources":[{"name":"greatlakesadvocate.com.au","url":"https://www.greatlakesadvocate.com.au/story/9319537/surprise-inflation-drop-eases-chance-of-rba-rate-hikes/"}],"published_at":"2026-07-29T06:52:24Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"c719d505a5551550","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T12:21:21Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-29T06:52:24Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-29T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"AS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-8018379.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit":"debannja","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/river-trees-bushes-riverscape-8018379/"}}